        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Two (2) years continuous experience as an Ophthalmic Photographer with The Permanente Medical Group or with other hospitals or clinics, and the ability to perform duties required of this position as determined by the Chief of Ophthalmology. One (1) year experience in other hospitals or clinics and one (1) year of experience with The Permanente Medical Group will also satisfy the experience factor.",
