        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This classification shall meet all the educational and skills requirements as set forth by the Employer and in addition must have the demonstrated ability to perform the following functions and does perform these activities the vast majority of time to the satisfaction of the Employer Biometric Measurements; Visual Fields; Stereo Photo/Photography; Retinometry; Fluorescein Angiograms; Keratometry; Tonography.",
            "block_bbox": [
                143,
