        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Individuals must be able to perform and meet all the requirements of Ophthalmic Photographer. May be required to perform tasks of an Operating Assistant and meet those requirements as specified in the Labor Agreement. May be required to be certified as an Ophthalmic Technician by the Joint Commission on Allied Health Personnel in Ophthalmology and/or three (3) to six (6) months of minimum practical related experience with the Employer.",
